  Legacy Facebook facepile embed was removed because it depended on
  the old Rails.application.config.auth settings, which are no longer
  present after the Rails 7 upgrade. The markup is kept minimal here
  so the sign-up page still renders without social widgets.
.facepile
  %div{style: "border:none; overflow:hidden; width:#{width}px; height: 90px"}
    <!-- social facepile disabled -->
